description=Root hiding made simple, powerful when you need it. A [KernelSU](https://kernelsu.org) module and WebUI that turns SuSFS into clean config files and toggle switches for everyday use, with built-in spoofing and hiding scripts for one-tap protection, plus a script editor for power users who want more, all without leaving the WebUI.
